# ── workspace rule ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node: node_modules/, Rust: target/, Frontend build: dist/.
# Three of these things have build artifacts in any language, see sub-packages.

# ── dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# ── build artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
target/
# tauri-generated schema/capabilities, regenerated whenever cargo build runs
gen/schemas/
# incremental artifacts of tsc -b
*.tsbuildinfo
.vite/

# ── secrets and trust roots (priority: never commit the private key) ──
.keys/
*.pem.dec
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── runtime data (CLI / demo / local index) ────────────────────────────
# The entire demo directory is random data generated by npm run demo / npm run vectors, can be rebuilt at any time
demo/
tools/tmp/
# The repo output to the current directory by cas pack (the packaging product is not source code)
/repo/
install-*/
.cache/
# sqlite indices of the client CAS and their WAL companions (products at runtime, not a contract)
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal

# ── logs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/

# ── dangling artifacts (name-based pairs, prevention in case) ───────────
# half-built file names during install/fix
*.cas-part
*.cas-tmp

# ── OS / editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# An important example of deliberate versioning (do not add to ignore list):
#
#   packages/cas-core-rs/tests/fixtures/    [Byte-level cross-verification contract]
#     vectors.json / signed manifest / chunk objects. These are protocol contract data;
#     after modifying the chunk constants, it must be regenerated together via `npm run vectors`.
#     Note: the `/repo/` in the "runtime data" section above only targets the root directory (anchored),
#     and here the fixtures repo needs to be versioned. To restore it from the ignore list, first
#     roll back its parent directories one by one.
!packages/cas-core-rs/tests/fixtures/repo/
!packages/cas-core-rs/tests/fixtures/repo/**
#
#   apps/launcher/src-tauri/icons/icon.ico   [Build resource even though generated]
#     node tools/gen-icon.mjs can regenerate it, but committing it ensures
#     a fresh cargo build works without node.
#
#   package-lock.json                        [Dependency lock]
#     Deterministic CI, do not ignore.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
